# Nine-slice frame, 4px border. The dialogue box and every menu panel.
#
# Deliberately the least interesting frame in the repo: this one has words in
# it, and every pixel of ornament competes with the thing the player is
# actually here to do.
name visualnovel-ui-frame
size 16 16
key o outline
key P room-3-hilite
key p room-2
key q room-1
key Q room-0-shadow
pixels
oooooooooooooooo
oPPPPPPPPPPPPPPo
oPppppppppppppPo
oPpqqqqqqqqqqpPo
*8 oPpqQQQQQQQQqpPo
oPpqqqqqqqqqqpPo
oPppppppppppppPo
oppppppppppppppo
oooooooooooooooo
